What is subject in RxJS?

A subject is a special type of observable that allows values to be multicasted to many observers.
Subjects are like EventEmitters.


So using subject we can emit some data and that data can be subscribed by many observers.

Why we use subject in RXJS?

The main purpose of using a subject is to make cross component communication.
so using subject the cross component communication is very easy.


